%% IQTerra Peer-Review Platform — High-Level Architecture
flowchart TB
  subgraph External[External Learning Environment]
    Moodle[Moodle LMS\nCourses · enrolment · submissions · gradebook]
    Moodle --> LTI
  end

  subgraph App[IQTerra Peer-Review Application ]
    Browser[Browser]
    Frontend[React + TypeScript + Vite\nCourse dashboard · assignment editor · student review UI]
    API[FastAPI application\nAuthentication · role checks · course APIs · review APIs]
    Rules[Domain services\nAllocation engine · question logic · moderation workflow]
    Export[Backup and export service]
  end

  subgraph Storage[Local Data Boundary]
    SQLite[(SQLite\ndata/iqterra.sqlite3)]
    Uploads[(Local uploads\ndata/uploads/)]
    Audit[(Review audit +\nmoderation history)]
  end

  Browser --> Frontend
  Frontend -->|JSON / REST| API
  API --> Rules
  API --> SQLite
  API --> Uploads
  Rules --> SQLite
  Rules --> Audit
  Export --> SQLite
  Export --> Uploads

  LTI -..-> API
  API -. future approved grades .-> LTI

  Health[/GET /health/]
  API --> Health

